+2. **Verdict posting.** Zero verdicts post to WO issues at any stage — before landing, after landing, ever. Proof beyond the stall: #1914's PR #1915 landed hours before this report (run-12 verified, content live on main) and #1914 still shows `bridge:queued`, no verdict, no comments. Same for #1931 (its gate script is live on main per run-14 verification).
